  "introTitle": "Paransori",
  "introTagline": "A little clarity for every day.",
  "introQuestion": "If sound had a color,\nwhat would it be?",
  "introPoem": "Clear as a blue sky,\nfresh as a cool breeze,\ncalm as a gentle sea.",
  "introStarted": "Paransori began with a simple wish: to bring these sounds into everyday life.",
  "introNameLabel": "The Meaning Behind Paransori",
  "introNameStory": "In Korean, \"paran\" means blue, and \"sori\" means sound. Together, they form \"Paransori\" — a name inspired by clear blue skies, peaceful seas, refreshing breezes, and the comfort of nature.\n\nRather than translating our name into \"Blue Sound,\" we chose to preserve its original Korean pronunciation, written in the Latin alphabet as \"Paransori.\"\n\nBorn in Korea, we hope this name will become familiar to people around the world, bringing a little more calm and joy to everyday life.",
  "introEverydayTitle": "Sound in your everyday",
  "introMoments": "When you need a short break in a busy day,\nwhen a favorite song comes to mind,\nwhen you want to discover a new radio station,\nwhen you want a quiet moment with the sounds of nature.",
  "introEveryday1": "Paransori hopes to be a comfortable companion in all kinds of everyday moments.",
  "introEveryday2": "A single song, a familiar radio show, or the soft sound of rain can make an ordinary day feel a little better. That's why we're building Paransori as a space for sound with less complexity and more joy in listening — easy and comfortable for anyone to use.",
  "introSoundsTitle": "Sounds you'll find in Paransori",
  "introWishTitle": "What Paransori hopes to share",
  "introWish1": "Time with the sounds we love is closer than we think — as the morning begins, in the middle of work, and on quiet nights as the day winds down.\n\nWe hope everyone can find the sounds they want, easily and comfortably. So we bring many kinds of sound together in one place, letting you simply enjoy every moment of listening, free from complexity.",
  "introWish2": "Paransori began in Korea, and we hope it can be part of people's lives around the world, adding a little joy and ease to every day.",
  "introClosing1": "Your place for music, radio, and nature sounds, anytime.",
  "introClosing2": "A little more calm in every day.",
  "introSign": "Paransori.",
